# Spec Kit per-session state: rewritten on every feature switch, and overridden
# by the SPECIFY_FEATURE_DIRECTORY env var. Committing it makes parallel feature
# branches conflict on a pointer rather than on content.
.specify/feature.json

# NOTE: dilaAIMarkupPlugin.xml and dilaAIMarkupPlugin.zip are deliberately NOT
# ignored. They are build outputs (regenerated at the `install` phase), but git
# is this project's only publication channel for the Oxygen add-on - there is no
# CI or release host - and the descriptor's <xt:location href="..."> is relative,
# so the pair must travel together. They have been committed at every release
# since 0.2.3. Entries ignoring them used to sit here and never took effect,
# because .gitignore does not apply to already-tracked files.
